<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Open Notes – Systems</title><link>https://nagarajrpoojari.github.io/opennotes/categories/systems/</link><description>Recent content in Systems on Open Notes</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 15 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0530</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://nagarajrpoojari.github.io/opennotes/categories/systems/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Picasso Programming Language</title><link>https://nagarajrpoojari.github.io/opennotes/projects/picasso/</link><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0530</pubDate><guid>https://nagarajrpoojari.github.io/opennotes/projects/picasso/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/nagarajpoojari404/picasso-lang" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;View on GitHub&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="#installation--usage"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quickstart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="#language-syntax--features"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Syntax Guide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picasso&lt;/strong&gt; is a modern, statically typed compiled systems programming language designed from first principles. It combines the raw performance and predictable resource utilization of native compiled code with the developer ergonomics, safety, and conciseness of modern high-level languages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Picasso eliminates traditional systems programming friction through built-in lightweight green threads, automatic garbage collection, rich synchronization primitives, and zero-cost abstractions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="architectural-highlights"&gt;Architectural Highlights&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="architectural-highlights"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#architectural-highlights" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div role="img" aria-label="Diagram"&gt;
&lt;pre class="mermaid hx:mt-6"&gt;
flowchart TD
Source[Picasso Source Code .pic] --&amp;gt; Lexer[Lexer &amp;amp; Tokenizer]
Lexer --&amp;gt; Parser[AST Parser &amp;amp; Semantic Analyzer]
Parser --&amp;gt; TypeCheck[Static Type Checker]
TypeCheck --&amp;gt; IR[Intermediate Representation / LLVM IR]
IR --&amp;gt; Opt[Optimization Pipeline]
Opt --&amp;gt; Native[Native Machine Code Executable]
subgraph Runtime [Picasso Runtime Engine]
GC[Garbage Collector]
Scheduler[M:N Green Thread Scheduler]
Sync[WaitGroups &amp;amp; Atomic Primitives]
end
Native -.-&amp;gt; Runtime
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="key-features"&gt;Key Features&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="key-features"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#key-features" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Native Compilation&lt;/strong&gt;: Compiles directly to native machine code without virtual machine overhead or JIT warm-up latency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Procedural with First-Class Object Support&lt;/strong&gt;: Combines structured procedural programming with clean object-oriented class definitions and methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expressive Static Type System&lt;/strong&gt;:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Signed &amp;amp; unsigned sized integers: &lt;code&gt;int8&lt;/code&gt; through &lt;code&gt;int64&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;uint8&lt;/code&gt; through &lt;code&gt;uint64&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Floating point numbers: &lt;code&gt;float&lt;/code&gt; (32-bit), &lt;code&gt;double&lt;/code&gt; (64-bit)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primitive strings, booleans, and dynamically resizable arrays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Atomic primitives for thread-safe lock-free operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;User-defined composite classes and structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Built-in M:N Concurrency (Green Threads)&lt;/strong&gt;:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spawn lightweight green threads effortlessly with &lt;code&gt;thread(fn, args...)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No cumbersome &lt;code&gt;async/await&lt;/code&gt; syntax coloring or promise chaining&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of scaling to hundreds of thousands of concurrent tasks with minimal stack footprint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Non-Preemptive Blocks &amp;amp; Synchronization&lt;/strong&gt;:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical atomic regions via non-preemptive code blocks &lt;code&gt;(* ... *)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built-in &lt;code&gt;WaitGroup&lt;/code&gt; primitives for coordinating parallel workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automatic Garbage Collection&lt;/strong&gt;: High-throughput memory management—allocate dynamically without manual memory freeing or fear of memory leaks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="language-syntax--features"&gt;Language Syntax &amp;amp; Features&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="language-syntax--features"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#language-syntax--features" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="1-variables--primitive-types"&gt;1. Variables &amp;amp; Primitive Types&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="1-variables--primitive-types"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#1-variables--primitive-types" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-c" data-lang="c"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Variable declarations
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;int32&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;age&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;25&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kt"&gt;double&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;pi&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mf"&gt;3.1415926535&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;greeting&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;Hello, Picasso!&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kt"&gt;bool&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;isActive&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Dynamic arrays
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;int32&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;numbers&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;];&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;numbers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;append&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
